@startuml

title US13 - List Employees by Role\nSystem Sequence Diagram (SSD)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #334155
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9E6

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "UKLabsMS" as System

' =====================================================
' Main Success Scenario
' =====================================================

Admin -> System : Requests employee list

System --> Admin : Requests employee role

Admin -> System : Provides the selected role

System --> Admin : Displays employees matching the\n selected role and their total count


@enduml
